## Corresponding source

Every release is compiled from the revisions pinned in [`upstream.lock`](upstream.lock):

| Component | Revision |
| :--- | :--- |
| compsize | commit `d79eacf77abe3b799387bb8a4e07a18f1f1031e8` |
| btrfs-progs (headers, build time only) | tag `v5.11` (commit `3ea5d6584c495d17868487a2f66b26a482bc9402`) |

The complete corresponding source for any release therefore consists of:

1. the upstream `compsize` source at the pinned commit, and
2. this repository, which contains the build scripts, the packaging steps and the exact
   compiler invocation (`build/build-static.sh`, `build/make-ipk.sh`, `build/make-apk.sh`).

